      "passageText": "# Local Barbershop Wins State Competition\n\nBy Miranda Warren\n\nMALENDA COUNTY (January 12)—Pat and Kenny’s Barbershop, [[1]] at 3949 Grand Street, has been named the best barbershop in the state by the Barber and Hairdresser’s Coalition. The criteria for selection include reputation, affordability, professionalism, and accreditations. [[2]].\n\nFounders and owners Kenneth Webber and Patrick Miller have been best friends since childhood. [[3]] opened the shop 34 years ago. [[4]] the shop retains its old-fashioned charm, the barbers have mastered the latest styles, not just the more traditional ones. People of all ages seeking a haircut or a new style should try Pat and Kenny’s Barbershop."
    },
    "editoriallyApproved": true
  },
